# SwiftFormat options for this package.
#
# The review gate runs SwiftFormat with these four options. This file states the
# same four options, so a bare `swiftformat` run agrees with the gate.
#
# Give the paths before `--lint`, because SwiftFormat reads the word after
# `--lint` as a value for that option:
#
#     swiftformat Sources Tests Examples --lint
#
# This file does not change the trailing-comma behavior. SwiftFormat writes a
# trailing comma at the last item of a multi-line list, and `.swiftlint.yml`
# holds `trailing_comma: { mandatory_comma: true }` so that SwiftLint accepts
# that comma. The two files must stay in agreement.

--pattern-let inline
--short-optionals always
--single-line-for-each convert
--guard-like-if-statements convert
